{"product_id":"learning-math-with-albert-levels-1-to-10","title":"Learning Math with Albert – Levels 1 to 10","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"551\"\u003eIntroduce your child to the world of mathematics with the Learning Math with Albert series. Designed for young learners, this comprehensive program takes children from basic concepts to more advanced mathematical skills, all while keeping the learning process fun and engaging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"793\"\u003eEach level builds upon the previous one, ensuring a solid foundation in math. Through colorful illustrations and relatable scenarios, children will learn to recognize numbers, understand basic operations, and develop problem-solving skills.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"981\"\u003eIdeal for parents seeking to enhance their child's mathematical abilities at an early age, this series offers a structured approach to learning that aligns with developmental milestones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1066\"\u003eTitle: Learning Math with Albert – Levels 1 to 10\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1124\"\u003ePublisher: Educational Technologies Limited (ETL)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003eSeries: Total Development Program – Skills\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1207\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover Books\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1233\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809410179225,"sku":"3RA456","price":200.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_c7b4119e-2172-4232-877a-f9cd83c10709.jpg?v=1761058092","url":"https:\/\/bookl